-- Entitlement — a profile's grant to an item, with optional expiry and
-- grace period. 10 fields: bare EntityRef profileId, three Maybe
-- EntityRef fields (itemId, grantedByPurchaseId), plus Date / Maybe
-- Date / Maybe String fields for the grant lifecycle.
--
-- Static rows: none. Identity (label / description / icon) is
-- registered by defineSystemEntity on the TS side.
--
-- Phase 3d of the system-entities sweep — see
-- workstreams/ts-elimination/briefs/phase-3d-system-entities-wholesale-flip.md.
-- Three "drop the Id suffix" overrides (profileId → "Profile", itemId
-- → "Item", grantedByPurchaseId → "Granted by purchase"). The other
-- seven fields humanize cleanly.

@entity
@codeName "entitlement"
@label "Entitlement"
@description "A profile's grant to an item — with optional expiry and grace period"
@icon "key"
@fieldLabel "profileId" "Profile"
@fieldLabel "entitlementSlug" "Entitlement"
@fieldLabel "itemId" "Item"
@fieldLabel "grantedByPurchaseId" "Granted by purchase"
@fieldLabel "grantedByStep" "Granted by step"
Entitlement = Entitlement profileId: EntityRef<"profile"> entitlementSlug: String itemId: Maybe (EntityRef<"item">) grantedByPurchaseId: Maybe (EntityRef<"purchase">) grantedByStep: Maybe String startsAt: Date expiresAt: Maybe Date graceEndsAt: Maybe Date revokedAt: Maybe Date revokedReason: Maybe String
